      "writtenOn": "2016-12-02T16:32:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah the design is actually a little iffy, but this method is always called by ShortcutUser.loadFromXml() which converts RuntimeException to ShortcutService.InvalidFileFormatException.  You could catch IAE here and throw InvalidFileFormatException, but that\u0027ll be a bigger change than necessary as you\u0027ll need to update multiple method signatures across multiple files, so just throw it here and I\u0027ll do something about it on master.\n\n(The reason why I catch them at the call site is I don\u0027t want to catch every single possible runtime exceptions that could happen while loading a file; there are other possible exceptions that could be caused by malformed files.)",
      "parentUuid": "4db723b6_aae7cf63",
